Result: BUILD SUCCESSFUL. 7 tests, zero skips/failures/errors: TargetCommandStoreTest 5 parameter cases, TargetPublishOutcomeVerifierTest 1, TargetPublishRetryDecisionTest 1. checkstyleMain and checkstyleTest passed. Three strict Worker/RocksDB parameter cases now apply full UNCERTAIN_HOLD with fixture history images and a real hash-matching immutable policy. They retain the attempt reserve and strict barrier, persist system/source-position results/frontier, and retry ACK_UNKNOWN without another write or authority resolution. A missing history context and an Admission image resigned with another signing-key version both fail Store preparation with unchanged sequence/frontier and no first result. Pure tests reject mismatched completed attempt, first time, deadline or policy; crypto/tuple/time checks cover a historical writer with a different active Owner snapshot and propagate unavailable authority.

Scope limit: this is local fixture evidence for current nonterminal no-next UNKNOWN only. Actual cross-Owner takeover, production history retrieval and retention/replacement proofs, uncertain retry work, definitive/terminal/historical Outcome projection, Producer integration, Broker response loss/restart and central validation remain open. No wire body, activated tuple or persistent schema changes. E5 remains IN_PROGRESS / PENDING_CENTRAL_VALIDATION.

